stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> drafted : coverage-affecting change, EL1
    drafted --> held : adapter schema fails, EL2
    held --> drafted : data fixed, EL3
    drafted --> validated : schema passes, census payload frozen, EL4
    validated --> sent : batch sealed and sent, EL5
    sent --> sent : no ack past SLA, resent byte-identical, EL8
    sent --> acknowledged : insurer accepts the line, EL6
    sent --> rejected : insurer rejects the line, EL7
    acknowledged --> premium_adjusted : insurer states premium change, EL9
    rejected --> superseded : correcting line created, EL10
    acknowledged --> reversed : later correction reverses it, EL11
    drafted --> cancelled : cause withdrawn before send, EL12
    held --> cancelled : cause withdrawn before send, EL12
    validated --> cancelled : cause withdrawn before send, EL12
    premium_adjusted --> [*]
    superseded --> [*]
    reversed --> [*]
    cancelled --> [*]

    note right of sent
        Never inferred from a file being generated.
        Exception queue holds it until acknowledged, BEN-11.
    end note

    note left of rejected
        Coverage window voided, CV3.
        A correction is a new line that names this one.
    end note
